<title>UK: OKB sets 1.0 billion Czech crown bond due 2000.</title>
<headline>OKB sets 1.0 billion Czech crown bond due 2000.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Creditanstalt-Bankverein.</p>
<p> BORROWER   OESTERREICHISCHE KONTROLLBANK AG</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  AUSTRIA, REPUBLIC OF</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN CZK   COUPON     10.25     MATURITY    10.APR.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.0     PAY DATE    10.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.25	REOFFER    PAR	 SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 25-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/CZ/AU</p>
